5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I am Minato. I am very happy to meet you all here today.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Greetings. I am Benjamin. Let us proceed with logic and calm, shall we?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,Peace be with you. I am Servas. Wisdom comes from listening to the wind.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi there! I'm May. This is going to be a fun little mystery, isn't it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I'm Takumi. I don't like waiting around. Let's get this started properly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,I wonder what our roles are. It feels a bit scary but also exciting to find out.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Fear is a poor strategist. Let us observe the patterns of speech before acting.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"The heart reveals what the mouth hides. Watch their eyes, not just their words.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,I'm just here to enjoy the show. Who's the wolf? I bet it's someone quiet.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,Quiet people are usually the smartest. I'm not scared. I'll protect my friends.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I hope we can all be friends. I don't want anyone to get hurt or sad.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,Friendship is a luxury we may not afford. Survival is the only true goal.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"We are all connected. If one falls, the whole tree trembles. Be kind.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"Benjamin, you're so serious! Lighten up a bit. We're just playing a game, right?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I agree with May. Benjamin, you're being too hard on everyone. We need to work together.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"I will try my best to help everyone. Please trust me, I mean well.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Trust is earned through action, not words. We shall see how the night unfolds.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,"May the stars guide your path. Sleep well, my friends. The truth will emerge.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,Goodnight everyone! I can't wait to see who gets caught in the act tomorrow.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Goodnight. I'll be watching. Don't think I won't notice if you're up to something.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
