31,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I feel a bit tired but ready to help. Who did the Seer check?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I have performed my duty. The results are clear, though I will not reveal them yet.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,The night has passed. The sun rises on a new day of truth and deception.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,Morning! I had a great sleep. I hope the Seer found something interesting last night.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Morning. I'm ready to work. Benjamin, you said you checked someone. Who was it?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,I don't know who the Seer is. I just want to know who is safe and who is not.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Patience, Minato. Revealing too early is a mistake. Let the others speak first.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Silence is golden, but so is the right word at the right time. Listen closely.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"Benjamin, you're being so mysterious. It's a bit annoying. Just tell us who you checked.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm with May. Benjamin, stop hiding. We need the info to make a good decision today.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,I am a little confused. Why is everyone so serious? I just want to play nicely.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Because, Minato, if we are not serious, we will lose. And losing is not an option.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,The wolf hides in plain sight. It wears the face of a friend. Be wary.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"Servas, you're so dramatic! It's just a game. Let's not make it too intense, okay?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Servas is right. We need to be careful. I don't trust Benjamin's silence. He's hiding something.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,I don't want to fight. I think we should all talk more and listen to each other.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Listening is good. But action is better. I will reveal my check now. Takumi is human.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,A good start. The human is safe. Now we must find the wolf among the rest.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"Oh, Takumi is safe? That's good. I like Takumi. He's funny. So who is the wolf?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"Thanks, Benjamin. I knew I was safe. Now, who else did you check? Or are you done?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
