64,2,1,talk,Minato,,Takumi is gone. I am very sad. I hope he is in a better place now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Grief is a luxury. We must focus. Takumi was human. The wolf remains.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Servas,,The tree has lost a branch. The wind blows colder now. We must be stronger.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,May,,I'm so upset. Takumi was my favorite. I'm angry at whoever did this.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Minato,,I don't know who did it. I just want to find the wolf and stop the sadness.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,I have checked May. She is human. That leaves Minato and Servas as suspects.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Benjamin, you accuse me? I am a man of peace. Why would you doubt my soul?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,May,,"I'm human? That's good. I knew I was safe. Benjamin, why did you check me?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Minato,,I am just a child. I don't know how to be a wolf. I only want to be kind.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Kindness is a mask, Minato. Or perhaps you are the wolf in sheep's clothing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Benjamin, your words are sharp. But I have seen many faces. I am not the wolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,May,,"Benjamin, you're being really mean to Minato. Minato is sweet. I don't think he's the wolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Minato,,I am not the wolf. I promise. I am just a little boy who likes to play.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Promises are cheap. I will vote for Minato. The logic points to him.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Servas,,I will vote for Benjamin. His aggression is a sign of the wolf's nature.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,May,,I'm voting for Benjamin. He's too aggressive and he's accusing everyone. It's suspicious.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
