91,3,1,talk,Minato,,Benjamin is gone too. I am very confused. I don't know what to do anymore.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
92,3,1,talk,Servas,,The path is narrowing. We are few now. The truth is close. Let us find it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
93,3,1,talk,May,,I'm scared now. We're down to three. I don't want to be next.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
94,3,2,talk,Minato,,I am still here. I am still kind. Please don't hurt me. I am just a child.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
95,3,2,talk,Servas,,"Minato, you have been quiet. Too quiet. The wolf hides in silence. Are you the wolf?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
96,3,2,talk,May,,"Servas, don't be so harsh. Minato is just shy. I think he's safe. I'm safe too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
97,3,3,talk,Minato,,I am not the wolf. I am a villager. I just want to live. Please believe me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
98,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I have seen your eyes, Minato. They do not lie. You are human. I am the wolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
99,3,3,talk,May,,"What? Servas, you're the wolf? I can't believe it. I'm so angry at you.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
100,3,4,talk,Minato,,"I am so sad. I thought you were my friend. Why did you do this, Servas?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
101,3,4,talk,Servas,,The game is over. The wolf has won. I am sorry for the pain I have caused.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
102,3,4,talk,May,,"I hate you, Servas. I will never forgive you. This is the worst game ever.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
